{"server":"tw","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_st01","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_st01","title":"候車大廳","storyCode":"RS-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"f02f2db19d9ed969e76f3693513ba637acc2c3383d8eaacd0a5f29b828cc19ec","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"1100年冬，謝拉格佩爾羅契家族領地內，聖山腳下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加快步伐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了我們是來做什麼的，後面的都跟上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立定！靠攏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原地列隊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告長官！第二小隊已整隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三小隊還沒有到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告長官！還沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，第三小隊那邊恐怕情況不妙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還等不等他們過來會合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不等了。我早料到可能會有這種情況，誰先抵達，誰就先一步發動攻擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於接下來的作戰計劃，想必不用我再多說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一場遠征，是屬於我們維多利亞人的戰鬥！是榮譽的戰鬥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時刻保持警覺！不要小看任何一個敵人！這一仗……只能成功，不能失敗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，保持士氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二小隊聽令，繼續進軍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目標——山下牧獸老頭的酒館！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對不能在酒量上輸給那群牧獸佬！這次一定讓他們輸得心服口服！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格平民男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格平民男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那群維多利亞人又在幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格平民女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拼酒量吧？他們都跟萊利大叔他們拼了好幾場了，聽說這群人每次都喝到吐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格平民女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德在上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格平民女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人……平常都這麼閒，都沒事可做嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g8_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好，這個不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“卓默密”……嗯，好像還不錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦，你說呢？你覺得叫“卓默密”怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你就沒有別的評價了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我每次問你，你都這麼說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我真的覺得得你取的名字都好聽，露絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，你說了不算，我得再仔細考慮一下，這可是我們第一次……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我一定要選一個最好的名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“卓默密”可以備選，“塔米亞斯”好像也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我們還可以另外再取一個綽號，就叫……“小堅果”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毛毛躁躁，我在門外都能聽到你的大嗓門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼“小堅果”？你這是在為你們未來的孩子取名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日安，大夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒有……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你別胡說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不逗你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德像已經建成，過兩天就是舉辦落成典禮的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間，我恐怕都抽不開身。領地這邊的事，你們倆多看著點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我你就放心吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是交給你，我才放心不下，我的好妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，這次我可沒出岔哦，你罵不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦，你老婆在外面該不會也是這副蠢樣子吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你怎麼說！我告訴你菈塔托絲，這次我也有自己的安排！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦我這邊的事成，就連那個恩希歐迪斯也得欠我們布朗陶家一個人情，你就等著看吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就等著對你刮目相看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我姑且相信你，不過還是要提醒你，謹慎一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德像完工，維多利亞人的動向，還有恩希歐迪斯的計畫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，哪一件都不是小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間……恐怕是要不太平了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g4_boudoir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豈有此理！這群維多利亞人真是欺人太甚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要聖女大人您下令，我立刻就清點人手，保證把這群人趕出謝拉格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請冷靜一些，阿克托斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的隊伍是為祝賀耶拉岡德像落成而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼樣的祝賀需要來兩千人？這就是個幌子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們甚至在聖山腳下紮營，毫無信仰之心！讓這樣的人參加兩天後的儀式，我看反而會觸怒耶拉岡德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人！我們真的就這麼任由這群人在謝拉格如此行事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說得沒錯，我很清楚他們並無敬仰耶拉岡德之心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯大人，難道我們的耶拉岡德像僅是為了造與信徒瞻仰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看一看，看一看這座像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_i01_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年之前，我們通過了希瓦艾什家的提案，決定在銀心湖上建造一座耶拉岡德像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它應當莊嚴偉岸，它應當慈悲寬仁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它將成為謝拉格人的精神寄託，將成為謝拉格面向外界的最顯著標誌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時各位應該就已預想過，未來將會有更多的人來到謝拉格，很多事情我們無法避免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話雖如此，可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有可是，阿克托斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於謝拉格人而言，耶拉岡德是不可動搖的信仰，這是其他外來之人無法體會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論是否擁有虔誠的信仰，人們都將來到這座代表耶拉岡德的雕像前，沐浴耶拉岡德的榮光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是聖女大人，如今的情況並不像您所描繪的那樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有普通遊客，我當然不會多說什麼！可現在我們面對的是維多利亞的軍隊，這不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們面對的是“軍隊”，還是“貴族的護衛”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，是“維多利亞”本身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們以慶賀為名請求進入謝拉格，阿克托斯大人，我們找不出拒絕或阻撓的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是他們明顯來者不善，萬一……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g4_boudoir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我至今，仍不贊同恩希歐迪斯大人某些太過冒險的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管這確實為謝拉格帶來了發展……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯他這三年到底都在做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在礦產的出口問題上小動作不斷，這次維多利亞人的事，是不是也是他惹出來的禍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須要“不清楚”，阿克托斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論恩希歐迪斯大人在暗中如何籌劃，一切皆是他的一意孤行，我與蔓珠院自然毫不知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時，知道得太多並不是一件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是陳述事實而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的儀式不容任何閃失，我們現在該做的，是做好我們能做的一切準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必如此擔憂，阿克托斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論如何……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德會庇佑祂的子民。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g4_boudoir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人，您在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，阿克托斯提到耶拉岡德像……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩天後的儀式，希望能夠一切順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會順利的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“耶拉岡德會庇佑祂的子民”，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我還是希望，這一次能不用打擾祂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您希望祂一直看著就好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格總要學會面對風險和挑戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒，孩子總不能一輩子在母親的攙扶下走路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您說得很有道理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，話題怎麼又變得沉重起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到耶拉岡德像，這個阿克托斯，我真想給他一巴掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個大雕像的臉，會整成現在這個樣子，就是他從典籍裡找到的根據吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還堅持說什麼“耶拉岡德的尊貌古有記載，絕不可變”呢，我的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，耶拉岡德的臉哪有那麼寬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真該打！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩雅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼不說話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不會吧，肯定是你又在逗我了，這不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我……不對，耶拉岡德的臉真的……很寬？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g5_victoriabarracks_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩日後的清晨，聖女大人將在銀心湖舉辦祝福儀式，以慶祝耶拉岡德像正式落成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是您的邀請函，子爵閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，恩希歐迪斯老爺，哈哈，謝拉格人是這麼叫的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您太客氣了，我們本就是為此而來，哪裡敢勞煩您特地準備邀請函。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請放心，當天我和我的士兵們肯定準時到場，慶祝我們的耶拉岡德像完工……敬耶拉岡德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看來您很適應在謝拉格的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格風景好，菜餚有特色，老鄉們也熱情，我怎麼能不喜歡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不枉公爵閣下時常盛贊謝拉格是風水寶地，果然名不虛傳啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……公爵閣下過獎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓遠道而來的客人如此誇讚，是謝拉格，也是我希瓦艾什家的榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯老爺不必過謙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說我們這次來，是為慶賀耶拉岡德像落成，但這段時間下來，我可算是真心實意被謝拉格的魅力俘虜啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必以公爵閣下一貫的體恤，應當會允許我在儀式結束後，在謝拉格再多遊玩一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯老爺，該不會不歡迎我做個觀光客吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子爵閣下有心深入了解謝拉格，我當然求之不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過謝拉格天寒地凍，這個季節，山間看不見的危機不在少數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您與貴軍團的士兵們還是要注意防寒，即便是觀光，也請避開一些危險之處，以免被風雪凍傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這可真是貼心的提醒啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格確實是太冷了一點，不過不勞恩希歐迪斯老爺掛心，這不是什麼大問題，一件外套就能解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，就我個人而言，比起去冰天雪地中體驗登山，我更愛在溫暖的房子裡點燃壁爐，然後吃上一口乳酪鍋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那滋味，嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽您這麼說，我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心？不，不不不，這話不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕恩希歐迪斯老爺不能放心，反而要更用點心才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……願聞其詳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，恩希歐迪斯老爺，憑您與公爵閣下的關係，許多事情恐怕不必我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位雖說體恤部下，對謝拉格也是一片親近、喜愛有加，但大人物的耐心嘛，總是有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與您在謝拉格的合作若是一直不順，萬一公爵閣下失了耐心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想你我都不希望事態最終發展到那般境地，恩希歐迪斯老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子爵閣下的意思我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於貴方提出的“合作”，近日內我會給出一個答案。不會讓公爵閣下等待太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望能從您那裡聽到點好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您會聽到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邀請函已經送到，就不打擾子爵閣下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩日後的儀式，恭候您的到場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這謝拉格的小子走的時候連個招呼都不打，太狂妄了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞子爵","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他這是做樣子給我看呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做樣子？你們這些聰明人，整天就會打啞謎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈洛德，我看你這兩天心情不怎麼樣，他沒給你找麻煩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亂想什麼！這毛頭小子是有點本事，但還沒到能讓我睡不著覺的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可以了，別胡思亂想，該來的躲不過，該幹嘛就去幹嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，你心裡有數就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，那我就先忙去了，嗝，應付那群老爺就靠你了，哈洛德！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等會，別走，你們是不是又喝酒不帶上我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我站住！酒就算了，我剛剛吃到一半的乳酪鍋你們給我端到哪裡去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g3_traincarriage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（謝拉格語）你好……再見……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心……呼呼……我一定會替你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*含糊不清的謝拉格語*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈……呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？！什麼人膽敢偷襲——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼時候睡著了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……屁股痛。這車真夠晃的，坐得我全身骨頭都快散了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——呼啊，舒服多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女坐直身體，把之前用來在車上打發時間，不知道什麼時候滑落到椅子下方的書籍撿起，塞進包裡。\n她伸了個大大的懶腰，將視線轉向車窗外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是謝拉格的景色啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了山比烏薩斯多點，其他的不都差不多？到處都是雪，又乾又冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底有什麼好的，讓你們都這麼念念不忘……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"各位旅客，本次列車即將抵達終點站——謝拉格聖山腳下。\n請到站的旅客收拾好行李，有秩下車。\n想要前往城區的旅客，可於二號月臺轉車，或選擇搭乘巴士。\n想要前往銀心湖，遊覽最新落成的耶拉岡德像的旅客，請前往三號月臺轉車。\n謝拉格歡迎各位旅客的到來！祝您旅途愉快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！終於到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"借過，不好意思，借過一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，終於出來了……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太恐怖了，這下車的人也太多了吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看，下了車之後先往左走，從檢票口出去，然後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這地圖畫的什麼鬼啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的馱獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哞——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！什、什麼東西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞——！哞哞——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？馱獸？車站裡怎麼會有馱獸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長得還挺壯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯，小姐，我看你是第一次來我們謝拉格吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老伯，你看得出來啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，第一次來的外鄉人，我一看就知道啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這馱獸，可是我們這的特色項目，聖女大人親自取的名哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫、叫什麼來著，哦，對啦！這叫“跑跑馱獸”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“跑跑馱獸”……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞、哞哞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啦，就是這個名啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你看這個，這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是想騎馱獸啊，就按一下這個按鈕，把這隻馱獸放出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，聽話，聽話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這馱獸都是馴養了好久，一個個挑出來的，聰明得很勒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐想去哪裡都可以，到了地方，直接把錢放到這馱獸身上的袋子裡就好了嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈好玩耶！真的能騎馱獸上街嗎？也太酷了吧，我喜歡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸老伯，那要是有人到了地方賴帳怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，小姐，在我們謝拉格，想賴帳可沒那麼容易！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看見這裡貼的這張聲明了沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞——！哞哞哞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“如顧客有違約行為，遭受提供服務的馱獸攻擊，產生的一切人身傷害與財產損失，本公司概不負責”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馱獸還會自己討帳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞哞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱情的馱獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1163_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哧——！嘖——哞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不錯！就應該這麼對付賴帳的傢伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回頭有機會我一定要試試！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯，真是個好小姐，喜歡就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"趕馱獸的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不耽誤你趕路了，歡迎來謝拉格啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等等，老伯……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走得真快，我還想問個路呢……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊從這裡穿過去……嗯，應該沒走錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三號月臺，三號月臺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立定！靠攏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原地列隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼會有士兵出現在車站？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_281_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是最近出了什麼大事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立正！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大膽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，沒什麼事，上次我還看到他們一起來買紀念品，搞不好也是來觀光的呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大膽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過他們這身衣服看著是不怎麼暖和，你看，那小伙子都冷得流鼻涕了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……丟臉，還不趕快擦擦！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（上次在特產店買給你們的厚外套呢？怎麼不穿上？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拜託，哈洛德！你買的那外套……每件上面都繡著“我愛雪山”啊！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼了，我覺得很好啊。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我也覺得挺好的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……好，那你留著自己穿吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等一下，哪來的小女孩啊？！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我？別在意我，你們繼續討論啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就是看這塞了這麼多人，一時好奇過來看看……聽到你們在討論忍不住加入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請不要道歉，您真是一位非常有品味的女士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有品味……說我嗎？哈哈，大叔你看人很有眼光嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特產店賣的大衣剛剛我也看到了！雖然衣服上繡“我愛雪山”俗了點，但確實很保暖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老練的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我承認你說的，哈洛德。這位女士確實很有品味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，你們不是普通人吧？你們是來謝拉格幹嘛的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大叔？好吧，我勉強可以接受這個稱呼，我家的不孝女確實和女士您差不多年紀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於我們，哈哈，我們只是來觀光的，就和女士您一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是單純來觀光的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，大叔，你知道三號月臺該從哪走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三號月臺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，我要轉乘去銀心湖的那班列車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大叔你也不知道？那算了，那我再去問問別人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"且慢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要問三號月臺……這您可就問對人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要說誰最熟悉這車站內外的環境，我哈洛德·克雷加文稱第二，沒人敢稱第一！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦！真的假的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"千真萬確。本人從不對女士說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從一個月前走下列車的那一刻起，我就已經成為這片熱鬧的俘虜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的每一家店，我都花時間逛過，對面新開業的那家紀念品店，當初還邀請了我來剪綵呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我敢說，就連這裡的馱獸，對我和我的兄弟們，都比對其他遊客更和善！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈……你確定這的馱獸對你們更和善？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喏，你看，你說的馱獸正在啃那邊那個兄弟的衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不客氣的馱獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呣，哞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不客氣的馱獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看，我沒說謊吧，這小傢伙和我們多親近啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈哈哈！我看著你的兄弟好像不怎麼想要這種親近！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……笑死我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，說正經的，我急著趕路，最好天黑前能到銀心湖……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您聽到了嗎，女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到……你指什麼？月臺提示？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，這正是三號月臺的列車進站的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我，很巧，正好與您同路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更加準確地說，我的目的地是銀心湖上的耶拉岡德像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是我，在這裡的所有人，最終都會搭上這趟列車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩日後，所有人的目光都將匯聚在那座雕像上……我們都是為此而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建這個耶拉岡德像，原來是這麼了不起的事啊……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧！作為一介遊客，我認為它也確實是不錯的觀光景點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——請問我是否有這個榮幸，邀請您一起踏上這趟觀光之旅，女士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
